- Breaking change: Removed "Delete report by name" and moved "Delete report by ID" to `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:id`. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/id/:id` still works but is deprecated, so switch scripts to it before you upgrade. `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/:name` and `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/queries/:name` return 410 with a link to the Fleet 5 upgrade guide. For a report whose name is only digits (for example `42`), `DELETE /api/v1/fleet/reports/42` deletes the report with that ID instead. API-only users with "Delete report by name" get "Delete report by ID".
